---
title: Piña Colada
image: https://www.crazyforcrust.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/easy-pina-colada-4.jpg
servings: 4
source: https://www.youtube.com/shorts/cAud9MZdqcs
---

Add @white rum{1%cup}, @coconut cream{1%cup}, @pineapple juice{2%cups}, and @ice{4%cups} to a #blender{}. 

Blend on high for ~{30%seconds}.

Garnish glasses with @?cherry{} or @?pineapple slice{}.

> Apparently cream of coconut vs coconut cream is a very important distinction. Generally, every video I've seen just references Coco Reàl, a cream of coconut, despite saying coconut cream. Just go for Coco Reàl if you can, but if not and you're using a can, make sure you mix it thoroughly before measuring.